    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "52A8E06EF1BB7844",
      "text": "Ich habe gehört, dass du nach mir gefragt hast.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "52A8E36EF1BB7D5D",
      "text": "Also bin ich in Windeseile in ein Flugtaxi gehüpft\\nund hergekommen.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "52A8E26EF1BB7BAA",
      "text": "In meinem Unterricht wird den Schülern einiges\\nabverlangt. Das macht doch sicher nichts, oder?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "52A8DD6EF1BB732B",
      "text": "Falls etwas passieren sollte, übernimmst du doch\\nbestimmt die Verantwortung, nicht wahr?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "52A8DC6EF1BB7178",
      "text": "Hihi, so gefällt mir das! Du bist immer bereit,\\nals [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0806,0000)]RetterRetterin in der Not einzuspringen.\\r\\nKeine Sorge, das war nur ein Witz.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0806",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_05b",
      "hash64": "305FAA84C1812F2E",
      "text": "Hihi... Süß, wie du dich sorgst. Aber keine Angst,\\nich habe nur gescherzt.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "FC4317675651B988",
      "text": "Ich fühle mich geehrt, dass du mich wiedersehen\\nwolltest.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "FC4318675651BB3B",
      "text": "Übrigens, erinnerst du dich noch, als was ich\\nin erster Linie arbeite?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "25883AAEC9E113C2",
      "text": "Flugbegleiterin",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "258839AEC9E1120F",
      "text": "Künstlerisches Naturtalent",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "258838AEC9E1105C",
      "text": "Make-up-Artist",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "FC4319675651BCEE",
      "text": "Aber nicht doch. Ein Beruf, bei dem makelloses\\nStyling gefragt ist, würde zwar auch gut zu mir\\r\\npassen, aber ich bin Make-up-Artist.\\c\\nMerk es dir fürs nächste Mal.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 167,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "F7C0B697ACE361E4",
      "text": "Bitte? Nein, das klingt nach etwas für seltsame,\\nabgedrehte Leute.\\c\\nIch arbeite als Make-up-Artist. Merk es dir fürs\\nnächste Mal.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_02c",
      "hash64": "F7C0B797ACE36397",
      "text": "Das ist goldrichtig! Genau, ich arbeite mit\\nMake-up! Nebenbei bin ich aber auch als\\r\\nModel und Arenaleiterin tätig.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "FC431A675651BEA1",
      "text": "Hier an der Akademie kennt mich kaum jemand,\\naber die Leute sind immer sehr interessiert,\\r\\nwenn ich von meinem Arbeitsalltag spreche.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "FC431B675651C054",
      "text": "In Paldea bin ich eine Berühmtheit, aber hier in\\nÜbersee fange ich eben wieder als Niemand an.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "FC431C675651C207",
      "text": "Und wo ich schon dabei bin, mir hier einen\\nNamen zu machen, sollte ich die Geheimnisse\\r\\nmeiner Schönheit auch gleich weltweit verbreiten![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "CE890D60F3760F59",
      "text": "Sag mal, erinnerst du dich noch an das\\nVersprechen, das du mir gegeben hast?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "CE890C60F3760DA6",
      "text": "Es freut mich, dass du dich an den Rat erinnerst,\\nden dir jemand gegeben hat, der älter ist als du.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_01b",
      "hash64": "68EDCCBDB199640C",
      "text": "Es ist zwar ganz süß, dass du vorgibst, dich nicht\\nzu erinnern, aber das lass ich dir nur ein Mal\\r\\ndurchgehen, okay?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "CE890B60F3760BF3",
      "text": "Du hattest mir versprochen, dass du weiter an\\ndeinem Können feilst...[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "CE890A60F3760A40",
      "text": "Und es scheint, als hättest du dieses Versprechen\\neingehalten! Und du hast... hihi! Du hast meine\\r\\nErwartungen sogar übertroffen![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "CE891160F3761625",
      "text": "Ich würde dich gern bei mir einstellen, wenn du\\nalt genug bist. Was meinst du?\\c\\nDir würde bestimmt die ganze Welt zu Füßen\\nliegen.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "3AC4424555EA2645",
      "text": "Ich würde mich freuen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "3AC43F4555EA212C",
      "text": "Hmm, ich weiß ja nicht...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "CE891060F3761472",
      "text": "Hihi, na ja, du musst dich jetzt noch nicht\\nfestlegen.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "5FDF20F4F514844B",
      "text": "Dieses neue Versprechen darfst du aber nicht\\nvergessen, hörst du?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "5FDF1FF4F5148298",
      "text": "Vielleicht braucht es irgendwas, damit du dich\\ndaran erinnerst...[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "5FDF22F4F51487B1",
      "text": "Wie wäre es zum Beispiel mit einem\\nPokémon-Tausch?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "5FDF21F4F51485FE",
      "text": "Hihi, das wollte ich hören! Von mir bekommst du\\nein Flattutu. Was gibst du mir dafür?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
